      "value": "本条只写该TradingView脚本页已印出的规则。ADX Length默认14；threshold默认10；Moving average 1 默认20；Moving average 2默认20；Long side默认false；Short side默认false。多条件=sig > threshold 且 rising(sig, 1) 且 falling(prev_sig, 1) 且 收 > avg 且 收 > avg2→entry long。空条件=sig > threshold 且 rising(sig, 1) 且 falling(prev_sig, 1) 且 收 < avg 且 收 < avg2→entry short。反向/出场→strategy.close。RSI+Hull+ADX+EMA：sig阈∧rising/falling∧双均过滤核 ≠ 纯Hull+EMA 或 ADX单腿。计入加密。提出日期按源文件原样保留Oct 16, 2021。"
